      "source_review": [
        "All mutable native controller paths carry an explicit resident Context; no global selected controller.",
        "Host registration IDs are not reused; device identity includes controller ID and runtime generation; public USB-v2 layouts are unchanged.",
        "Catalogue reset/removal is scoped to one controller ID. Callback leases prevent registration reuse during a callback.",
        "Per-instance port/IRQ/worker records and class admission exist; only the first controller is started in this foundational step."
      ],
